# The whole-graph aggregates are NOT committed. Ronald ruled on 2026-09-01
# that all.jsonld is not a contract and that files this large belong in
# GitHub releases: git rejects any blob over 100 MB, and this repository
# published nothing between 2026-08-20 and that ruling because harmonize
# succeeded and the push was refused on these two files at 152.13 MB and
# 110.11 MB.
#
# They are still PRODUCED — harmonize keeps --combine — and uploaded to a
# release by the workflow, so the artefact survives and only its transport
# changes.
